WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.620
- So, is it true that you still send Oprah

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:05.070
two thank you letters like a year?

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:09.300
- I do, you know Oprah
and I met in the late 90s

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.980
when she was in trial and
I was on the trial team.

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:15.400
And then I started doing the show

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.900
and then started doing the show a lot.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.010
And then we launched the show

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:24.010
and it really changed my life a lot.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.410
I had a great life when I met her

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:28.830
and I've got a great life now,

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.527
but she changed a lot of things

00:00:30.527 --> 00:00:35.200
and it's just been really
important to me every year

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:40.130
to stop, sit down and
write her a letter and say,

00:00:41.437 --> 00:00:45.069
"Thank you for the impact
you've had on me and my family."

00:00:45.069 --> 00:00:49.510
And I've done it every
year for 25 or 26 years.

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:51.640
And she told me something one time,

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:54.043
the first time I launched
a book on her show,

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:59.180
I sent her like a huge flower arrangement

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:00.527
and a thank you note stuff

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:04.480
and I think she'd been on the
air 17 years at that point.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:05.897
And she called me and said,

00:01:05.897 --> 00:01:07.537
"You know about all the things I've done

00:01:07.537 --> 00:01:08.937
"all the books and stuff," she said,

00:01:08.937 --> 00:01:11.930
"This is the first time
anybody's ever said thank you."

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:13.100
- What?

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:15.120
- First time anybody's
ever said thank you.

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:16.380
- Oh, wow.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:18.600
- And I thought, wow,

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:19.901
that's hard to believe.
- [Kelly] That's depressing.

00:01:19.901 --> 00:01:21.090
Yeah.

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:23.450
- And now I've had my show for 20 years,

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:25.050
I understand what she means.

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:26.290
- Oh, man.

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:27.300
- I understand what she means.

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:31.700
And so I don't know, I've got this value,

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:33.970
don't forget who brung you to the dance.

00:01:33.970 --> 00:01:34.803
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:34.803 --> 00:01:37.170
- And I've never let her think

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:38.970
I forgot who brung me to the dance.

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:40.523
- [Kelly] Yeah, I love that.

